{"title":"Install with Java (JAR)","description":"Run the Stirling PDF server as a Java application on Windows, macOS or Linux, with the conversion tools installed yourself.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Install with Java (JAR)</h1>\n<p>Run the server as a plain Java application when Docker isn't an option. You install Java and the conversion tools that the <a href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/\">Docker image</a> has built in.</p>\n<h2 id=\"choose-a-jar\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Choose a JAR<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#choose-a-jar\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Web interface</th>\n<th>Login and admin settings</th>\n<th>Use it for</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases/latest/download/Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar</a></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Most servers. Recommended.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases/latest/download/Stirling-PDF.jar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling-PDF.jar</a></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>One user who needs no login.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases/latest/download/Stirling-PDF-server.jar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stirling-PDF-server.jar</a></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>API-only use or a custom frontend.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All three are attached to every <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub release</a>. The examples below use the with-login JAR.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-install-java-25\" class=\"anchor-heading\">1. Install Java 25<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#1-install-java-25\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"os\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"windows\" aria-selected=\"true\">Windows</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"mac\" aria-selected=\"false\">macOS</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"linux\" aria-selected=\"false\">Linux</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"windows\">\n<p>Install <a href=\"https://adoptium.net/temurin/releases/?version=25&amp;os=windows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eclipse Temurin 25</a> and let the installer add Java to your PATH.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"mac\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openjdk@25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'export PATH=\"$(brew --prefix openjdk@25)/bin:$PATH\"'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Open a new terminal afterwards.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"linux\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Debian / Ubuntu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt-get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> openjdk-25-jdk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Fedora</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dnf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> java-25-openjdk</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>If your distribution has no Java 25 package, use <a href=\"https://adoptium.net/temurin/releases/?version=25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eclipse Temurin 25</a>.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>Check it with <code>java -version</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-download-and-start-the-server\" class=\"anchor-heading\">2. Download and start the server<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#2-download-and-start-the-server\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Put the JAR in its own folder, open a terminal there and run:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Open <code>http://localhost:8080</code> and sign in as <code>admin</code> / <code>stirling</code> (see <a href=\"/Server/#first-login\">First login</a>). Others on your network use <code>http://&lt;server-ip&gt;:8080</code>.</p>\n<p>Stirling PDF keeps its settings, database and logs in folders such as <code>configs/</code> and <code>logs/</code> inside the folder you start it from, so always start it from the same place. See <a href=\"/Server/Configuration/#file-locations\">Configuration</a>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"or-use-a-package-manager\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Or use a package manager<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#or-use-a-package-manager\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h3><p>These install the with-login JAR and a <code>stirling-pdf-server</code> command that starts it.</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"os\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-1\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"windows\" aria-selected=\"true\">Windows</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"mac\" aria-selected=\"false\">macOS</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"linux\" aria-selected=\"false\">Linux</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"windows\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">powershell</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scoop bucket add java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scoop install https:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">raw.githubusercontent.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">homebrew</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scoop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stirling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pdf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.json</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Update with <code>scoop update stirling-pdf-server</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"mac\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Stirling-Tools/stirling-pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf-server</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Update with <code>brew upgrade stirling-pdf-server</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"linux\">\n<p>With <a href=\"https://brew.sh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Homebrew on Linux</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Stirling-Tools/stirling-pdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf-server</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<h2 id=\"3-install-the-conversion-tools\" class=\"anchor-heading\">3. Install the conversion tools<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#3-install-the-conversion-tools\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>At startup, Stirling PDF looks for these programs and turns off any tool whose program is missing. The startup log lists what was turned off. Install only what you need, then restart Stirling PDF.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Program</th>\n<th>Enables</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>LibreOffice</td>\n<td>Office documents to and from PDF, PDF/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tesseract or OCRmyPDF</td>\n<td>OCR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ghostscript</td>\n<td>PDF/X, PostScript to and from PDF, PDF to PCL and XPS, <strong>Replace &amp; Invert Color</strong>, scanner effect, repair and stronger compression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QPDF</td>\n<td>Repair and stronger compression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ImageMagick</td>\n<td>The <strong>Convert images to line art</strong> option in <strong>Compress</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python 3 with OpenCV</td>\n<td>Detect and split scanned photos</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WeasyPrint</td>\n<td>HTML, Markdown, email and URL to PDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>unoserver</td>\n<td>Faster Office conversions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pdftohtml (Poppler)</td>\n<td>PDF to HTML and Markdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Calibre</td>\n<td>eBooks to and from PDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rar</td>\n<td>PDF to CBR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"os\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-2\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"windows\" aria-selected=\"true\">Windows</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"mac\" aria-selected=\"false\">macOS</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"linux\" aria-selected=\"false\">Linux</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"windows\">\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Install the programs you need:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.libreoffice.org/download/download-libreoffice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LibreOffice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/UB-Mannheim/tesseract/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tesseract</a>, choosing extra languages during setup</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://qpdf.sourceforge.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">QPDF</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.python.org/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python</a>, ticking <strong>Add Python to PATH</strong>, then <code>pip install opencv-python unoserver</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Kozea/WeasyPrint/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WeasyPrint</a>: put <code>weasyprint.exe</code> in a folder such as <code>C:\\weasyprint</code>. Some antivirus tools flag it, so you may need to allow it.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/pdftohtml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pdftohtml</a>: put <code>pdftohtml.exe</code> in a folder such as <code>C:\\pdftohtml</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add each program's folder to the system PATH: search Windows for <strong>Edit the system environment variables</strong>, select <strong>Environment Variables</strong>, edit <strong>Path</strong> under <strong>System variables</strong> and add, for example:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>C:\\Program Files\\LibreOffice\\program</code></li>\n<li><code>C:\\Program Files\\Tesseract-OCR</code></li>\n<li><code>C:\\Program Files\\qpdf\\bin</code></li>\n<li><code>C:\\weasyprint</code> and <code>C:\\pdftohtml</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Point Stirling PDF at the Tesseract language files in <code>configs/settings.yml</code> (or set <code>SYSTEM_TESSDATADIR</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tessdataDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'C:\\Program Files\\Tesseract-OCR\\tessdata'</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Open a new terminal and check each program, for example <code>tesseract --version</code> and <code>python -c &quot;import cv2&quot;</code>.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"mac\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> qpdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tesseract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tesseract-lang</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostscript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> imagemagick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> poppler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cask</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> weasyprint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unoserver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opencv-python-headless</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Point Stirling PDF at the Homebrew Tesseract files in <code>configs/settings.yml</code> (or set <code>SYSTEM_TESSDATADIR</code>). Use the output of <code>brew --prefix</code> followed by <code>/share/tessdata</code>, for example on Apple Silicon:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tessdataDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/opt/homebrew/share/tessdata</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"linux\">\n<p>Debian / Ubuntu:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt-get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-writer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-calc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-impress</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3-uno</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  tesseract-ocr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocrmypdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostscript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> qpdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> imagemagick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> poppler-utils</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3-pip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unoserver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> weasyprint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opencv-python-headless</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --break-system-packages</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Stirling PDF ignores QPDF older than 12 and ImageMagick older than 7, which is what Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 12 install.</p>\n<p>Fedora:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dnf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-writer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-calc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-impress</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> libreoffice-pyuno</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  tesseract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ocrmypdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostscript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> qpdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ImageMagick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> poppler-utils</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3-pip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unoserver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> weasyprint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opencv-python-headless</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Stirling PDF reads Tesseract languages from <code>/usr/share/tesseract-ocr/5/tessdata</code>. If your distribution puts them elsewhere, set <code>system.tessdataDir</code> in <code>configs/settings.yml</code> or the <code>TESSDATA_PREFIX</code> environment variable. To add languages, see <a href=\"/Server/Operations/OCR-Languages/\">OCR languages</a>.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>Office conversions work with LibreOffice alone. For faster conversions, also run unoserver next to Stirling PDF, which looks for it on <code>127.0.0.1:2003</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unoserver</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2003</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --interface</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 127.0.0.1</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>If a program is installed but not on the PATH, set its full path under <code>system.customPaths.operations</code> (<code>soffice</code>, <code>unoconvert</code>, <code>weasyprint</code>, <code>ocrmypdf</code>, <code>calibre</code>) in <code>settings.yml</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"run-as-a-service-on-linux\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Run as a service on Linux<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#run-as-a-service-on-linux\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ol>\n<li>\n<p>Create a user and move the JAR into place:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> useradd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --system</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --home-dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/Stirling-PDF</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shell</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/sbin/nologin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirlingpdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/Stirling-PDF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/Stirling-PDF/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> touch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/Stirling-PDF/.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirlingpdf:stirlingpdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/Stirling-PDF</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Put any environment variables in <code>/opt/Stirling-PDF/.env</code>, one per line, for example <code>SYSTEM_DEFAULTLOCALE=de-DE</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create <code>/etc/systemd/system/stirlingpdf.service</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">ini</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">[Unit]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=Stirling PDF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=network.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">[Service]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=stirlingpdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=stirlingpdf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">EnvironmentFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=/opt/Stirling-PDF/.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WorkingDirectory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=/opt/Stirling-PDF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ExecStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=/usr/bin/java -jar /opt/Stirling-PDF/Stirling-PDF-with-login.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SuccessExitStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=143</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">[Install]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WantedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=multi-user.target</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Start it and enable it at boot:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> daemon-reload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirlingpdf.service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirlingpdf.service</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"change-the-port-or-address\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Change the port or address<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#change-the-port-or-address\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Set it in <code>configs/custom_settings.yml</code>, or as environment variables, for example in the <code>.env</code> file above:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-3\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SERVER_ADDRESS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"